WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.512
Your daily coffee was once deemed demonic.

2
00:00:03.462 --> 00:00:07.125
Mystics drank it for terrifying midnight rituals.

3
00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:11.525
Kings banned it, fearing immediate, violent revolutions.

4
00:00:11.525 --> 00:00:15.200
Smugglers risked death to transport the beans.

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.825
Popes performed exorcisms on this black liquid.

6
00:00:18.825 --> 00:00:22.400
Women claimed it caused permanent male madness.

7
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.937
Is coffee energy, or secret mind control?

8
00:00:25.937 --> 00:00:28.862
Comment your theory and subscribe now.
